      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "舅頭有大瘤，齡石伺舅眠，密往割之，舅即死。",
      "reading": "齡石乘舅眠割瘤，其舅死。",
      "note": "齡石乘舅眠割瘤，其舅死。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p003",
