      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "高祖克京城，以為建武參軍。",
      "reading": "劉裕克京城後任之建武參軍。",
      "note": "劉裕克京城後任之建武參軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 26,
      "end_codepoint": 39,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence4-39",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "從至江乘，將戰，齡石言於高祖曰：「世受桓氏厚恩，不容以兵刃相向，乞在軍後。」",
      "reading": "齡石以世受桓氏恩請居軍後。",
      "note": "齡石以世受桓氏恩請居軍後。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 39,
      "end_codepoint": 77,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence4-77",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "高祖義而許之。",
      "reading": "劉裕許之。",
      "note": "劉裕許之。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 77,
      "end_codepoint": 84,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence4-84",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "事定，以為鎮軍參軍，遷武康令，加寧遠將軍。",
      "reading": "旋任鎮軍參軍、武康令、寧遠將軍。",
      "note": "旋任鎮軍參軍、武康令、寧遠將軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 84,
      "end_codepoint": 105,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence5-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "喪亂之後，武康人姚係祖招聚亡命，專為劫盜，所居險阻，郡縣畏憚不能討。",
      "reading": "武康姚係祖聚亡命為盜，郡縣畏之。",
      "note": "武康姚係祖聚亡命為盜，郡縣畏之。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 34,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence5-34",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "齡石至縣，偽與係祖親厚，召為參軍。",
      "reading": "齡石佯與係祖親厚，召其為參軍。",
      "note": "齡石佯與係祖親厚，召其為參軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 34,
      "end_codepoint": 51,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence5-51",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "係祖恃其兄弟徒黨強盛，謂齡石必不敢圖己，乃出應召。",
      "reading": "係祖恃兄弟徒黨應召。",
      "note": "係祖恃兄弟徒黨應召。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 51,
      "end_codepoint": 76,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence5-76",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "齡石潛結腹心，知其居處塗徑，乃要係祖宴會，叱左右斬之。",
      "reading": "齡石於宴會令斬係祖。",
      "note": "齡石於宴會令斬係祖。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 76,
      "end_codepoint": 103,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence5-103",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "乃率吏人馳至其家，掩其不備，莫有得舉手者，悉斬係祖兄弟，殺數十人，自是一郡得清。",
      "reading": "齡石繼討其家，係祖兄弟及數十人死。",
      "note": "齡石繼討其家，係祖兄弟及數十人死。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 103,
      "end_codepoint": 143,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence6-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "高祖又召為參軍，補徐州主簿，遷尚書都官郎，尋復為參軍。",
      "reading": "劉裕召齡石為參軍、徐州主簿、尚書都官郎，又任參軍。",
      "note": "劉裕召齡石為參軍、徐州主簿、尚書都官郎，又任參軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 27,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence6-27",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "從征鮮卑，坐事免官。",
      "reading": "從征南燕，因事免官。",
      "note": "從征南燕，因事免官。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 27,
      "end_codepoint": 37,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence6-37",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "廣固平，復為參軍。",
      "reading": "廣固平，復為參軍。",
      "note": "廣固平，復為參軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 37,
      "end_codepoint": 46,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence6-46",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "盧循至石頭，領中軍。",
      "reading": "盧循至石頭，齡石領中軍。",
      "note": "盧循至石頭，齡石領中軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 46,
      "end_codepoint": 56,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence6-56",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "循選敢死之士數千人上南岸，高祖遣齡石領鮮卑步矟，過淮擊之。",
      "reading": "盧循軍登南岸，劉裕命齡石出戰。",
      "note": "盧循軍登南岸，劉裕命齡石出戰。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 56,
      "end_codepoint": 85,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence6-85",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "率厲將士，皆殊死戰，殺數百人，賊乃退。",
      "reading": "賊退，傳稱死數百人。",
      "note": "賊退，傳稱死數百人。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 85,
      "end_codepoint": 104,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence6-104",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "齡石既有武幹，又練吏職，高祖甚親委之。",
      "reading": "齡石能治吏，受劉裕親委。",
      "note": "齡石能治吏，受劉裕親委。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 104,
      "end_codepoint": 123,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence6-123",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "盧循平，以為寧遠將軍、寧蠻護軍、西陽太守。",
      "reading": "平盧循後任寧遠將軍、寧蠻護軍、西陽太守。",
      "note": "平盧循後任寧遠將軍、寧蠻護軍、西陽太守。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 123,
      "end_codepoint": 144,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence6-144",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "義熙八年，高祖西伐劉毅，齡石從至江陵。",
      "reading": "義熙八年從裕西討劉毅至江陵。",
      "note": "義熙八年從裕西討劉毅至江陵。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 144,
      "end_codepoint": 163,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence7-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "九年，遣諸軍伐蜀，令齡石為元帥，以為建威將軍、益州刺史，率寧朔將軍臧熹、河間太守蒯恩、下邳太守劉鍾、龍驤將軍朱林等，凡二萬人，發自江陵。",
      "reading": "本傳義熙九年記齡石領二萬人自江陵伐蜀，列臧熹、蒯恩、劉鍾、朱林等官。",
      "note": "本傳義熙九年記齡石領二萬人自江陵伐蜀，列臧熹、蒯恩、劉鍾、朱林等官。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 68,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence7-68",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "尋加節益州諸軍事。",
      "reading": "加節益州諸軍事。",
      "note": "加節益州諸軍事。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 68,
      "end_codepoint": 77,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence7-77",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "初，高祖與齡石密謀進取，曰：「劉敬宣往年出黃虎，無功而退。",
      "reading": "劉裕引劉敬宣黃虎失利為前例。",
      "note": "劉裕引劉敬宣黃虎失利為前例。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 77,
      "end_codepoint": 106,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence7-106",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "賊謂我今應從外水往，而料我當出其不意，猶從內水來也。",
      "reading": "裕陳述蜀方可能如何理解晉軍來路。",
      "note": "裕陳述蜀方可能如何理解晉軍來路。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 106,
      "end_codepoint": 132,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence7-132",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "如此，必以重兵守涪城，以備內道。",
      "reading": "引述其對涪城守備所作判斷。",
      "note": "引述其對涪城守備所作判斷。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 132,
      "end_codepoint": 148,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence7-148",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "若向黃虎，正陊其計。",
      "reading": "續述黃虎。",
      "note": "續述黃虎。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 148,
      "end_codepoint": 158,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence7-158",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "今以大眾自外水取成都，疑兵出內水，此制敵之奇也。」",
      "reading": "敘劉裕所擬進軍方向。",
      "note": "敘劉裕所擬進軍方向。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 158,
      "end_codepoint": 183,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence7-183",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "而慮此聲先馳，賊審虛實，別有函書，全封付齡石，署函邊曰：「至白帝乃開。」",
      "reading": "記密函封授，署至白帝開。",
      "note": "記密函封授，署至白帝開。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 183,
      "end_codepoint": 219,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence7-219",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "諸軍雖進，未知處分所由。",
      "reading": "諸軍未知其內容。",
      "note": "諸軍未知其內容。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 219,
      "end_codepoint": 231,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence7-231",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "至白帝，發書，曰：「眾軍悉從外水取成都，臧熹、朱林於中水取廣漢，使羸弱乘高艦十餘，由內水向黃虎。」",
      "reading": "白帝發函，分記各軍與地名。",
      "note": "白帝發函，分記各軍與地名。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 231,
      "end_codepoint": 280,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence7-280",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "眾軍乃倍道兼行，譙縱果備內水，使其大將譙道福以重兵戍涪城，遣其前將軍秦州刺史侯輝、尚書僕射蜀郡太守譙詵等率眾萬餘屯彭模，夾水為城。",
      "reading": "譙縱遣譙道福、侯輝、譙詵備守。",
      "note": "譙縱遣譙道福、侯輝、譙詵備守。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 280,
      "end_codepoint": 345,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence8-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "十年六月，齡石至彭模，諸將以賊水北城險阻眾多，咸欲先攻其南城，齡石曰：「不然。",
      "reading": "本傳以十年六月記抵彭模及諸將議論。",
      "note": "本傳以十年六月記抵彭模及諸將議論。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p008",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 39,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence8-39",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "雖寇在北，今屠南城，不足以破北；若盡銳以拔北壘，南城不麾而自散也。」",
      "reading": "齡石說明所取先後。",
      "note": "齡石說明所取先後。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p008",
      "start_codepoint": 39,
      "end_codepoint": 73,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence8-73",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "七月，齡石率劉鍾、蒯恩等攻城，詰朝戰，至日昃，焚其樓櫓，四面並登，斬侯輝、譙詵，仍回軍以麾，南城即時散潰。",
      "reading": "七月破城，侯輝、譙詵皆死。",
      "note": "七月破城，侯輝、譙詵皆死。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p008",
      "start_codepoint": 73,
      "end_codepoint": 126,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence8-126",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "凡斬大將十五級，諸營守以次土崩，眾軍乃舍船步進。",
      "reading": "傳稱斬大將十五，諸營依次潰散。",
      "note": "傳稱斬大將十五，諸營依次潰散。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p008",
      "start_codepoint": 126,
      "end_codepoint": 150,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence9-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "龍驤將軍臧熹至廣漢，病卒。",
      "reading": "臧熹到廣漢病卒。",
      "note": "臧熹到廣漢病卒。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p009",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 13,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence9-13",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "朱林至廣漢，復破譙道福，別軍乘船陷牛脾城，斬其大將譙撫。",
      "reading": "朱林再敗譙道福，別軍斬譙撫。",
      "note": "朱林再敗譙道福，別軍斬譙撫。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p009",
      "start_codepoint": 13,
      "end_codepoint": 41,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence9-41",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "譙縱聞諸處盡敗，奔于涪城，巴西人王志斬送。",
      "reading": "譙縱奔涪城，巴西王志斬送；另書分說自縊與送首。",
      "note": "譙縱奔涪城，巴西王志斬送；另書分說自縊與送首。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p009",
      "start_codepoint": 41,
      "end_codepoint": 62,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence9-62",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "偽尚書令馬躭封府庫以待王師。",
      "reading": "馬躭封府庫待晉。",
      "note": "馬躭封府庫待晉。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p009",
      "start_codepoint": 62,
      "end_codepoint": 76,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence9-76",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "道福聞彭模不守，率精銳五千兼行來赴，聞縱已走，道福眾亦散，乃逃于獠中，巴西民杜瑤縛送之，斬于軍門。",
      "reading": "譙道福救彭模不及，杜瑤縛送而斬。",
      "note": "譙道福救彭模不及，杜瑤縛送而斬。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p009",
      "start_codepoint": 76,
      "end_codepoint": 125,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence10-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "高祖之伐蜀也，將謀元帥而難其人，乃舉齡石。",
      "reading": "回敘劉裕舉齡石為帥。",
      "note": "回敘劉裕舉齡石為帥。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p010",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 21,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence10-21",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "眾咸謂自古平蜀，皆雄傑重將，齡石資名尚輕，慮不克辦，諫者甚眾，高祖不從。",
      "reading": "諫者憂其資名輕，裕不從。",
      "note": "諫者憂其資名輕，裕不從。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p010",
      "start_codepoint": 21,
      "end_codepoint": 57,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence10-57",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "乃分大軍之半，猛將勁卒，悉以配之。",
      "reading": "以大軍之半配齡石。",
      "note": "以大軍之半配齡石。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p010",
      "start_codepoint": 57,
      "end_codepoint": 74,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence10-74",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "臧熹，敬皇后弟〔也。",
      "reading": "臧熹為敬皇后弟。",
      "note": "臧熹為敬皇后弟。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p010",
      "start_codepoint": 74,
      "end_codepoint": 84,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence10-84",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "資位在齡石之右，亦令受其節度。",
      "reading": "臧熹資位本高過齡石，奉命受節度。",
      "note": "臧熹資位本高過齡石，奉命受節度。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p010",
      "start_codepoint": 84,
      "end_codepoint": 99,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence10-99",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "是行亦不淹時，一戰克捷，眾〕咸服高祖之知人，又美齡石之善於其事。",
      "reading": "成功後眾服劉裕知人、朱齡石善任。",
      "note": "成功後眾服劉裕知人、朱齡石善任。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p010",
      "start_codepoint": 99,
      "end_codepoint": 131,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence11-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "齡石遣司馬沈叔任戍涪，蜀人侯產德作亂，攻涪城，叔任擊破之，斬產德。",
      "reading": "沈叔任戍涪，平侯產德之亂。",
      "note": "沈叔任戍涪，平侯產德之亂。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p011",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 33,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence11-33",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "初，齡石平蜀，所戮止縱一祖之後，產德事起，多所連結，乃窮加誅剪，死者甚眾。",
      "reading": "初只戮譙縱同祖之後，產德事後擴大刑殺。",
      "note": "初只戮譙縱同祖之後，產德事後擴大刑殺。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p011",
      "start_codepoint": 33,
      "end_codepoint": 70,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence11-70",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "進號輔國將軍，尋進監梁州之巴西梓潼宕渠南漢中、秦州之安固懷寧六郡諸軍事，以平蜀功，封豐城縣侯，食邑千戶。",
      "reading": "齡石進輔國將軍、監梁秦六郡，因平蜀封豐城縣侯，食邑千戶。",
      "note": "齡石進輔國將軍、監梁秦六郡，因平蜀封豐城縣侯，食邑千戶。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p011",
      "start_codepoint": 70,
      "end_codepoint": 122,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence12-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "十一年，徵為太尉諮議參軍，加冠軍將軍。",
      "reading": "義熙十一年徵太尉諮議參軍，加冠軍將軍。",
      "note": "義熙十一年徵太尉諮議參軍，加冠軍將軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p012",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 19,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence12-19",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "十二年北伐，遷左將軍，本號如故，配以兵力，守衞殿省，劉穆之甚加信仗，內外諸事，皆與謀焉。",
      "reading": "十二年北伐，齡石遷左將軍，守殿省，劉穆之倚重。",
      "note": "十二年北伐，齡石遷左將軍，守殿省，劉穆之倚重。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p012",
      "start_codepoint": 19,
      "end_codepoint": 63,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence13-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "高祖還彭城，以齡石為相國右司馬。",
      "reading": "劉裕還彭城，以齡石為相國右司馬。",
      "note": "劉裕還彭城，以齡石為相國右司馬。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p013",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 16,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence13-16",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "十四年，安西將軍桂陽公義真被徵，以齡石持節督關中諸軍事、右將軍、雍州刺史。",
      "reading": "十四年代桂陽公義真持節督關中、右將軍、雍州刺史。",
      "note": "十四年代桂陽公義真持節督關中、右將軍、雍州刺史。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p013",
      "start_codepoint": 16,
      "end_codepoint": 53,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence13-53",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "敕齡石，若關右必不可守，可與義真俱歸。",
      "reading": "若關右不可守，許與義真歸。",
      "note": "若關右不可守，許與義真歸。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p013",
      "start_codepoint": 53,
      "end_codepoint": 72,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence13-72",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "齡石亦舉城奔走。",
      "reading": "齡石舉城走。",
      "note": "齡石舉城走。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:p013",
      "start_codepoint": 72,
      "end_codepoint": 80,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhulingshi:received_sentence13-80",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "wip_vh5_2zm_A",
      "source_quote": "龍驤將軍王敬先戍曹公壘，齡石自潼關率餘眾就敬先，虜斷其水道，眾渴不能戰，城陷，虜執齡石及敬先還長安，見殺，時年四十。",
      "reading": "齡石投王敬先，城陷，俱被執還長安見殺，齡石年四十。",
